  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increasing Employability in the RE Sector - Phase II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project&#x2019;s overall objective is to strengthen the livelihoods and employment prospects of Syrians under Temporary Protection (SuTP) and the Turkish Citizens in T&#xfc;rkiye while supporting T&#xfc;rkiye&#x2019;s renewable energy (RE) sector. The project aims to contribute to the achievement of these dual objectives by capitalising on the potential synergy between employment support initiatives and the opportunities presented by the emergence of a young renewable energy sector.</narrative>
  </description>
